```json
{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, two beige adjustable chairs made with sturdy metal and soft fabric are placed—one positioned 0.5 meters away from a sage green rolling cart, and the other next to a brushed brass desk lamp. Three light oak wall shelves, minimalist and smooth, are mounted: one above a tan woven basket, another beside a white pegboard, and the third hanging over a terracotta potted plant. Four tan woven baskets, textured and sturdy, are arranged—one under the first wall shelf, another stacked next to a muted teal fabric bin, a third near a mustard yellow floor cushion, and the fourth positioned next to another fabric bin. The desk lamp sits atop the rolling cart, which is 0.3 meters from a natural bamboo yarn holder. The pegboard is adjacent to a brushed nickel scissors rack, while a matte gray ceramic vase rests on the second wall shelf. Two terracotta potted plants, earthy and rustic, are placed—one on the third wall shelf and another nearby. Two mustard yellow floor cushions, plush and square, are arranged beside each other, with one near a fabric bin. Three muted teal fabric bins, collapsible and roomy, are stacked—one on top of another, one under the second wall shelf, and the third next to a woven basket. A matte black hanging pendant light is suspended above the rolling cart, while a dark walnut paintbrush stand sits on the first wall shelf, and the scissors rack is mounted beside the pegboard."}
```

```json
{"speech": "A compact craft room with an understated, earthy design and a polished wooden floor creates a peaceful and welcoming atmosphere. Two beige adjustable chairs with sturdy metal frames and soft fabric are placed—one near a sage green rolling cart and the other beside a brushed brass desk lamp. Three light oak wall shelves are mounted: one above a tan woven basket, another next to a white pegboard, and the third over a terracotta potted plant. Four tan woven baskets are arranged—one under the first shelf, another stacked by a muted teal fabric bin, a third near a mustard yellow floor cushion, and the fourth next to another bin. The desk lamp sits on the rolling cart, close to a natural bamboo yarn holder. The pegboard is adjacent to a brushed nickel scissors rack, while a matte gray ceramic vase rests on the second shelf. Two terracotta potted plants add rustic charm—one on the third shelf and another nearby. Two plush mustard yellow floor cushions sit together, with one near a fabric bin. Three muted teal fabric bins are stacked—one under the second shelf and others nearby. A matte black pendant light hangs above the rolling cart, while a dark walnut paintbrush stand sits on the first shelf. The room connects to the outside via a warm brown solid oak door with subtle geometric carvings."}
```

